a0Following graduation from law school, Judge McFadden clerked for Judge Steven Colloton, U.S. Court of Appeals for the Eighth Circuit.\u00a0 He then joined the U.S. Department of Justice, where he served as Counsel to the Deputy Attorney General and as Assistant U.S. Attorney in the District of Columbia.\u00a0 Judge McFadden subsequently became a partner at Baker &amp; McKenzie LLP in Washington, DC, where he focused on white collar investigations.\u00a0 He is also co-author of a treatise, Corporate Settlement Tools: DPAs, NPAs, and Cooperation Agreements.After four years in private practice, Judge McFadden returned to the U.S. Department of Justice, where he was Deputy Assistant A", "large_image": "gTytC39ofTFHExvb.png", "title": "Hon. Trevor N. McFadden"}, "post_flair_text": "LAWFARE", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2115090518912692599", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToPft7YW", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 260, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8908160, "raw_content": "", "author": "grannylovestrump", "created": 1793129816127, "profile_picture": "J2VOs7hvr5If", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "2016TrumpMAGA", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToPft7YW.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/ScottPresler/status/2115090518912692599", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\u201cTo every person voting blue this upcoming November the 3rd, I wish you \n\nthe prosperity of Venezuela;\n\nthe salaries of Cuba;\n\nthe freedom of North Korea;\n\nthe human rights of China;\n\nthe women\u2019s rights of Iran;\n\nthe democracy of Russia;\n\n& the security of Mexico.\u201d", "last_comment_created": 1793158442060, "content"